# Audio files in music/ are opinionated-out of git. Use the manifest pattern:
# the .json file references them by URL (relative for repo-hosted, absolute
# for CDN-hosted). Drop tracks locally to test; force-add (git add -f) any
# you actually want shipped via GitHub Pages. See music/README.md.
music/*.mp3
music/*.wav
music/*.m4a
music/*.ogg
music/*.flac
